import workflow as w
c=w.connect();I='I_force_motion';II='II_oscillations_waves';III='III_ideal_gas';IV='IV_thermodynamics';VI='VI_electric_field';VII='VII_magnetic_field';IX='IX_em_oscillations_waves';X='X_wave_optics';XII='XII_atomic_nuclear'
rows=[
(1,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Rainfall mass redistribution and length of day','Ignoring evaporation is explicit. Angular momentum conservation and the change of Earth-atmosphere moment of inertia determine the sign and parameterized rotation change; no meteorological prediction is required.'),
(2,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Falling folded rope including energy and small-bend evolution','Actual U-shaped rope drawing was inspected. Newton tension/momentum flux for a flexible line and energy accounting determine falling-leg motion and possible dissipation; small semicircle geometry gives a first-order bend model. No flexural constitutive stiffness is centrally stipulated.'),
(3,'KEEP',[I,II],'theory','Two masses and a sliding-then-sticking cord over a thin rod','Actual geometry, cord length and artificial dynamic/static friction rules are supplied. Constrained Newton motion, energy before sticking and tension positivity determine the mass-ratio condition, with no realistic material-friction theory needed.'),
(4,'KEEP',[I,II],'theory','Anharmonic oscillations in a fully supplied inverse-power potential','Explicit 1D/central 2D potentials give equilibrium, curvature frequency, perturbative amplitude shift and central-force precession/trajectories through ordinary Newton and series mathematics.'),
(5,'KEEP',[I,II],'theory','Stability and normal modes of triangular Earth-Moon equilibrium points','Circular primaries and equilateral geometry define Newton restricted-three-body force in the rotating frame. Linearized gravity/Coriolis equations give stability, frequencies and mode trajectories without specialist celestial theory supplied as a remembered formula.'),
(6,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Coupled hollow and solid cylinders rolling down an incline','Mass, radius, thin-shell/solid inertia, contact ordering and all friction coefficients are given. Newton force/torque and no-slip acceleration constraints determine the allowed incline angles.'),
(7,'KEEP',[I,II],'numerical','Unwinding finite-radius twisted trapeze ropes with Coulomb friction','No stored torsion energy is expressly stipulated; rope lengths, suspension/rod geometry, winding count and friction are provided. Helical contact geometry, gravitational potential, rigid rotation and local Coulomb friction determine unwinding dynamics without elastic-torsion theory.'),
(8,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Envelope of equal-speed debris from colliding parabolic comets','Equal masses and opposite angular momenta set the collision frame. Newton conic families and geometric envelope construction give expanding debris; unspecified final speed can remain a collision-energy parameter.'),
(9,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Uniform-sphere gravity under a supplied inverse-power variant','Changing force exponent is explicitly the toy model. Integrating the pair force through the sphere and equating above/below acceleration at a given golden-section ratio is mathematical Newton superposition, not unsupplied modified-gravity theory.'),
(10,'KEEP',[I],'numerical','Tower taper set by explicitly prescribed pressure and torque balance','Square sections, pressure as a linear height function and equality of wind and weight overturning torques are printed. Static force moments and an integral/ODE determine taper and base width for a declared material density; bending elasticity is not requested.'),
(11,'KEEP',[II],'theory','Eigenfrequencies of a tension membrane with a circular material patch','The source expressly models the drum as a membrane. Scalar tension, areal mass and Newton transverse wave balance with displacement/force matching produce a piecewise membrane eigenproblem. Tension/density/size may remain material parameters; no plate-bending or 3D elastic tensor law is required.'),
(12,'KEEP',[I],'experimental','Methods for estimating fan lifetime from measurable wear indicators','The open task asks estimation methods, not a derivation of microscopic friction/wear. Monitoring vibration/play/current, endurance/accelerated tests and survival uncertainty are ordinary apparatus/data reasoning; a calibrated wear rate can be measured instead of importing an unsupplied tribology law.'),
(13,'KEEP',[I,VI],'theory','Equilibrium energy of a homogeneous interacting-particle potential','Homogeneity, static force equilibrium and Euler scaling identity give the energy condition and counterexamples. Ordinary mechanical force gradients and mathematical degeneracies/constraints suffice.'),
(14,'KEEP',[I],'experimental','Bubbles at an interface of two immiscible liquids','Experiment instructions describe sharp interfaces and differing surface tensions. Buoyancy, capillary pressure and surface-energy/wetting balance explain deformation, trapping or transfer under measured material parameters; no quantitative viscous evolution is required.'),
(15,'KEEP',[I,II],'numerical','Tide scale, spring/neap forcing and extreme coastal amplification','Newton differential lunar/solar gravity and hydrostatic scale give equilibrium tides and spring/neap combinations. Ordinary forced-wave resonance and basin geometry give an estimate/explanation of large coastal response; the source does not demand a full viscous coastal flow simulation.'),
(16,'REJECT',[],'theory','Stratified atmospheric gravity and radial acoustic eigenmodes','Hydrostatic density/pressure profile and gamma=1 are supplied, but compressible stratified fluid perturbation dynamics, gravity-wave coupling and outer radiation/reflection prescription are not. These central specialized continuum-fluid methods determine both complete mode/dispersion tasks; the equilibrium exponential alone is not an operational wave model.'),
(17,'KEEP',[I,VI,VII],'theory','Rigid electric dipole motion in a magnetic field','Sphere inertia and dipole moment define a rigid neutral charge-pair limit. Ordinary Lorentz forces on translating/rotating charges, torque and conserved energy/modified momentum give coupled centre/rotation dynamics for the supplied initial orientation.'),
(18,'KEEP',[VI],'theory','Spherical-surface electrostatic Green functions and circle-boundary data','The source explicitly says spherical Poisson equation defines electrostatics. Geometric Laplacian, zero-mode neutrality, multipole derivatives and Fourier Dirichlet solutions supply the task; no gravitational spacetime or relativistic field dynamics is needed.'),
(19,'KEEP',[I,VI,VII],'numerical','Magnetic dipole moment from free carriers in a rotating conducting sphere','Free electrons with specified mass/charge are explicitly allowed to redistribute. Newton centrifugal/electric force balance, charge neutrality and rotating-current integration give the magnetic moment and an Earth-field order comparison within classical EM.'),
(20,'KEEP',[VII],'theory','Force cancellation among three geometrically similar current loops','Actual radius/separation ratio and current signs are given. Biot-Savart magnetic interaction, scale invariance and symmetry show equal opposing forces; no quantum or material magnetization law is required.'),
(21,'KEEP',[VI],'theory','Effective resistance on a cylinder made from a diagonal resistor strip','Graph geometry, edge R and periodic shorting are fully specified. Kirchhoff nodal Laplacian/Fourier or random-walk mathematics calculates resistance, including N=2,3. Suggested Jeng article is optional, not a missing physical circuit model.'),
(22,'KEEP',[VI,VII,IX],'theory','Maxwell consistency of a harmonically varying point dipole field','Classical retarded potentials, distributional point source and Maxwell curl/divergence laws define the whole-space check. Harmonic dipole radiation is within operational EM; the Jackson citation does not introduce an unsupplied quantum model.'),
(23,'KEEP',[X],'theory','Atmospheric refraction of solar-disk shape and separated images','Ray refraction in a height-dependent index and solar angular extent determine compression and multiple-image conditions. Ordinary thermodynamic density/index estimates or measured profiles provide parameters; no atmospheric-fluid evolution theory is requested.'),
(24,'KEEP',[X],'theory','Passive sunlight concentrator across the daily solar path','Geometric reflection/refraction, angular acceptance and ordinary energy/brightness limits guide a fixed passive concentrator. Photovoltaic microphysics is motivation only; no semiconductor conversion calculation is demanded.'),
(25,'KEEP',[X],'theory','Moon image through a fully diagrammed cellular transparent roof','Actual two sheets, wall spacers, 0.3mm thicknesses, 1cm pitches and 2m direction were inspected. Snell reflections/refractions and finite viewing geometry trace image splitting/attenuation, with material index a parameter.'),
(26,'KEEP',[I,X],'experimental','Bright sunlight spots on soap bubbles on surfaces','Actual experimental instructions invite observation and explanation. Curved-film reflection/refraction, focusing and thin-film interference with ordinary capillary geometry account for bright spots; no actual experiment or observations are fabricated.'),
(27,'KEEP',[IV,X],'numerical','Illumination consequences of a stipulated second solar-system star','The statement expressly removes the stellar-creation mechanism and fixes luminosity by warming Europa. Inverse-square flux, radiative/thermal equilibrium and geometry yield Earth brightness/climate and other-body estimates; exotic engineering is not a prerequisite.'),
(28,'REJECT',[],'theory','Relativistic Nordstrom and reciprocal-mass scalar-force trajectories','Four-force laws are actually supplied, but proper-time/four-momentum, varying-rest-mass/orthogonality and 3D velocity mapping are not. Those central relativistic prescriptions are needed before the defined 4-force becomes a usable particle-motion model.'),
(29,'KEEP',[I,III],'numerical','Encounter rates in a cluster with a supplied gravitational-radiation frequency rule','The source gives f=v/b, density/size and frequency window and explicitly requests gas approximation then gravitational deflection. Ordinary collision-rate/impact-parameter counting, Newton hyperbolic focusing and a declared stellar mass/speed model give the frequency-qualified event rate. No wave-emission intensity or GR detector sensitivity calculation is asked.'),
(30,'REJECT',[],'theory','Covariant variable-light-speed gravity from a partial particle action','A classical particle action is supplied, permitting some formal mechanical variation. But covariant dynamics, equivalence-consistent field equation, curved metric, stress-energy and source-field action are not operationally provided. These central unsupplied relativistic field methods dominate the whole task.'),
(31,'BORDERLINE',[I],'theory','Elastic geometric forces on loosely rigid bodies in spatial manifolds','An embedded-surface Hooke-spring energy model could be built from ordinary mechanics and geometry, and the task allows choosing a model. A general intrinsic-manifold force/minimal-body result requires an unspecified distance/constraint/coupling prescription. No operational metric or dynamics is given; preserve the whole-model ambiguity rather than reject manifold terminology alone.'),
(32,'KEEP',[XII],'theory','Radon decay versus diffusive escape from a radium-bearing sphere','Radium source activity and diffusion coefficient are given parameters. Ordinary diffusion-decay conservation with a declared free-escape boundary gives radial stationary concentration, total decay activity and radius limits; no unsupplied nuclear microphysics is needed.'),
(33,'KEEP',[I,VI,XII],'numerical','Coulomb trajectory of a fragmenting lithium nucleus with supplied energy transfer','Initial energy, charge, mass numbers and excitation/separation/kinetic energies are all printed; absorbed momentum is explicitly neglected. Nuclear energy accounting and Newton Coulomb trajectories determine a parameterized centre path, subject to the unspecified breakup location/direction, without unsupplied relativistic boosts.'),
(34,'REJECT',[],'theory','Coupled electron-phonon Jahn-Teller classical and quantum model','A deformed potential is supplied, but quantum oscillator levels, perturbation/eigenstate/occupation machinery and complete phonon Hamiltonian are not. The quantum and reduced-Hilbert-space parts dominate the meaningful work. Suggested original paper was checked at APS: abstract available, full PDF 401/authorization required; it was not acquired as a complete supplied model.'),
(35,'REJECT',[],'theory','Spin-resolved spectrum of an electron ring in an inclined magnetic field','Hamiltonian and vector-potential/Zeeman labels are supplied, but quantum momentum/state representation, Pauli matrices and eigenvalue/flux boundary rules are not. These central quantum prerequisites determine the requested spectrum.'),
(36,'REJECT',[],'theory','Qubit decoherence in a supplied fluctuating metric and phase evolution','The metric matrix, Gaussian distribution and conditional phase evolution are explicitly supplied. Proper-time extraction along the path and reduced quantum state/partial-trace prescription are not; these missing relativistic/quantum definitions centrally determine the requested off-diagonal decay.'),
(37,'REJECT',[],'theory','Entangled-spin dense coding with supplied unitary actions','Initial singlet and all flips/phases/conditional transformations are described. Measurement observables/probabilities, quantum partial-state interpretation and no-disturbance rules needed to prove certain recovery and Eve ignorance are not supplied. Those central quantum measurement laws remain required despite the supplied gate algebra.'),
(38,'REJECT',[],'numerical','Intensity and mechanical use of a self-terminating light-sabre beam','No nonlinear photon interaction/confinement/termination model is supplied. Ordinary Maxwell propagation/radiation pressure alone does not yield the requested finite rod and threshold intensity; the central necessary physical mechanism is missing, not merely a science-fiction context.'),
(39,'KEEP',[],'theory','Parallel computer performance under a fully specified discrete stochastic model','Ring graph, alternating integer/half-integer states, waiting rule, duration probabilities, initialization and performance definition are printed. Finite-state/renewal/queue recurrences and limiting probability mathematics yield exact/controlled approximate performance; no processor physics is required.'),
(40,'KEEP',[III,IV],'mixed','Room and lecture-hall airing schedules under thermal and mixing estimates','Occupancy, solar heating, external variation, diffusion without flow and improved mixing with flow are described. Heat/particle balance, measured exchange/conduction coefficients and optimization define a defensible simplified schedule. No prescribed full turbulence/ventilation PDE is centrally demanded.'),
(41,'KEEP',[],'theory','Trajectory-pattern evidence and identifiability under limited observations','Only biologically generated paths may be observed and other signal/velocity concepts are explicitly excluded. Geometry, statistical pattern analysis and logical counterexamples establish candidate evidence and limits of any undisputed intelligence inference. No specialized biological mechanism or outside physical law is required to expose non-identifiability.'),
(42,'KEEP',[X],'theory','Apparent motion of a submerged boat seen from a moving aircraft','Plane height/path and a flat transparent sea surface define the model. Snell ray direction, viewing geometry and changing apparent-depth/image location give the trajectory; island/pirate narrative and 1991 reference are context only.')]
